  { k: "01", n: "bo, Bogenverbindung", f: "Textura, Grenze Gotisch Bold", d: "The honest blackletter answer. In textura, when a round letter follows a bowl, the two curves are not set side by side, they are fused: b\u2019s bowl and o\u2019s left stroke become one shared stroke. That \u201cbow ligature\u201d is centuries old, so the mark reads as type, not as an invented logo. Sharp broken curves, one vertical rhythm, works down to 16px.", svg: "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"14 -676 709 709\"><path transform=\"scale(1 -1)\" d=\"M273.0 467.0Q270.0 467.0 254.0 455.0L182.0 401.0L176.0 403.0L183.0 617.0Q183.0 621.0 175.0 630.0Q167.0 639.0 158.0 646.5Q149.0 654.0 146.0 654.0Q141.0 654.0 124.0 652.0Q107.0 650.0 85.5 647.0Q64.0 644.0 44.0 640.5Q24.0 637.0 14.0 635.0V583.0L53.0 569.0V20.0Q69.0 16.0 98.5 11.0Q128.0 6.0 160.0 1.0Q192.0 -4.0 216.5 -7.5Q241.0 -11.0 246.0 -11.0Q257.0 -11.0 280.5 1.0Q304.0 13.0 331.5 30.5Q343.87908935546875 38.377593994140625 355.4472351074219 46.25491714477539Q357.91668701171875 43.81835174560547 360.5 41.5Q419.0 -11.0 529.0 -11.0Q540.0 -11.0 563.5 1.0Q587.0 13.0 615.0 30.5Q643.0 48.0 666.0 65.5Q689.0 83.0 699.0 94.0Q708.0 118.0 715.5 160.0Q723.0 202.0 723.0 251.0Q723.0 355.0 666.5 411.0Q610.0 467.0 500.0 467.0Q489.0 467.0 464.5 454.5Q440.0 442.0 412.0 424.0Q401.68212890625 417.3670654296875 391.9070129394531 410.73388671875Q369.5990295410156 438.1906433105469 339.5 452.5Q309.0 467.0 273.0 467.0ZM531.0 58.0Q510.0 58.0 489.0 71.5Q468.0 85.0 454.0 120.0Q440.0 155.0 440.0 222.0Q440.0 296.0 448.0 341.5Q456.0 387.0 467.0 392.0Q474.0 396.0 481.0 396.5Q488.0 397.0 495.0 397.0Q528.0 397.0 547.5 375.0Q567.0 353.0 576.0 317.0Q585.0 281.0 585.0 237.0Q585.0 176.0 580.5 138.0Q576.0 100.0 572.0 77.0L563.0 72.5Q554.0 68.0 544.5 63.5Q535.0 59.0 531.0 58.0ZM252.0 372.0Q262.0 372.0 274.0 355.5Q286.0 339.0 294.0 308.0Q302.0 277.0 302.0 233.0Q302.0 173.0 298.5 135.0Q295.0 97.0 288.5 79.0Q282.0 61.0 273.0 57.0Q266.0 55.0 249.5 58.5Q233.0 62.0 21